<div class=" column -column1">
<h4 class=" c-small_headline">On board the Shinkansen, showing a luxury “Gran Class” carriage (left) and the space-efficient, five-seat design of a standard class “E7” carriage (right).</h4>
<div class="layoutBox">
<div class="layout2-1">
<div class=" c-body">
<div class="c-img   ">
<a href="../../_src/7935792/18_07.jpg?v=1578473167897" class="js-zoomImage" rel="width=709,height=523"><img src="../../_src/7935791/18_07.jpg?v=1578473167897" alt="" id="imgsrc7935791_1"></a>
</div>
